<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλίττω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔβλῐσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					564e
				</span></i>
			:—<i>cut out the comb of bees, take the honey</i>,
			l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφηκιὰν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					778
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. τὸν δῆμον</span>
			<i>rob</i> the people <i>of their honey</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				794
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				475
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεῖστονδὴ . . τοῖς κηρῆσι
				μέλι βλίττεται</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. τὰ σμήνη</span> the
			hives <i>have their honey taken</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				554a15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				627b2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλίσσειν:</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλάσσειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				16
			</span></i>. (For <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μλίτ</span>-<i>y</i><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ω</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλι</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
